        "TileImage": "$($repository 335ce4e7-36bb-45cd-aa24-18564d48ed4e).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47\r\rYour targets are Tren Po, Salman Al-Gazali and Amedée Paquin. All three are part of a criminal organisation called &apos;Blue Blood&apos;. We now very little about this organsation and we hope to collect more intel when you have taken care of these three. All we know is that Tren Po is connected to a coup in Khandanyang, sheik Al-Gazali has major control over oil reserves in Dubai and Amedée is a master manipulator. They all seem to be part of a royal family, even Amadée... \r\rGood luck 47",
